      *################################################################*03160001
      * Test permitted values                                          *03170001
      *                                                                *03180001
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*03190001
       C300-Permitted-Values             Section.                       03200001
      *                                                                 03210001
      *  This code is maintained by the codegenerator. Any user changes 03220001
      *  between the META tags will be lost. Any user code should be    03230001
      *  placed in the C310-... or C320... sections                     03240001
      *                                                                 03250001
      *<META C300-PERMITTED-VALUES>                                     03260001
      *
      *    Kontrakt-Nr must be numeric if present.
      *
           Evaluate True
             When  RTFCE120-I-Contract-No-I
                                         Not = 'U'
               Continue
             When  RTFCE120-I-Contract-No-D
                                         Not Numeric
               Move  'F'                 To    RTFCE120-I-Contract-No-O
               Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)
               Move  'Kontrakt-Nr'       To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)
               Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&' To    R400CH01-Message-Code
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE
           End-Evaluate
      *
      *    Rate-Nr must be numeric if present.
      *
           Evaluate True
             When  RTFCE120-I-Part-Amount-No-I
                                         Not = 'U'
               Continue
             When  RTFCE120-I-Part-Amount-No-D
                                         Not Numeric
               Move  'F'                 To
                                         RTFCE120-I-Part-Amount-No-O
               Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)
               Move  'Rate-Nr'           To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)
               Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&' To    R400CH01-Message-Code
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE
           End-Evaluate
      *
      *    Beløp must be numeric if present.
      *
           Perform
              Varying  Tally             From 1 By 1
              Until    Tally             >
                                         RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-A
              Evaluate True
                When  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-I(Tally)
                                         Not = 'U'
                  Continue
                When  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-D(Tally)
                                         Not Numeric
                  Move  'F'              To
                                         RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-O
                                               (Tally)
                  Move  'FELT1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)
                  Move  'Beløp'          To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)
                  Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code
                  Perform  Z700-Error-AE
              End-Evaluate
           End-Perform
      *
      *    Beløp-Basisvaluta must be numeric if present.
      *
           Perform
              Varying  Tally             From 1 By 1
              Until    Tally             >
                                         RTFCE120-I-Charge-Am-Base-A
              Evaluate True
                When  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Am-Base-I(Tally)
                                         Not = 'U'
                  Continue
                When  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Am-Base-D(Tally)
                                         Not Numeric
                  Move  'F'              To
                                         RTFCE120-I-Charge-Am-Base-O
                                               (Tally)
                  Move  'FELT1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)
                  Move  'Beløp-Basisvaluta'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)
                  Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code
                  Perform  Z700-Error-AE
              End-Evaluate
           End-Perform
      *
      *    Prosent-Provisjon must be numeric if present.
      *
           Perform
              Varying  Tally             From 1 By 1
              Until    Tally             >     RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-A
              Evaluate True
                When  RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-I(Tally)
                                         Not = 'U'
                  Continue
                When  RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-D(Tally)
                                         Not Numeric
                  Move  'F'              To    RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-O
                                               (Tally)
                  Move  'FELT1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)
                  Move  'Prosent-Provisjon'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)
                  Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code
                  Perform  Z700-Error-AE
              End-Evaluate
           End-Perform
