      *################################################################*05060001
      * Check dependencies between input fields                        *05070001
      *                                                                *05080001
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*05090001
       C500-Dependencies                 Section.                       05100001
      *                                                                 05110001
      *  This code is maintained by the codegenerator. Any user changes 05120001
      *  between the META tags will be lost. Any user code should be    05130001
      *  placed in the C510... or C520.. sections.                      05140001
      *                                                                 05150001
      *<META C500-DEPENDENCIES>                                         05160001
           Perform
              Varying  Tally             From 1 By 1
              Until    Tally             >     RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-A
              If  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-I(Tally)
                                         Not = 'U'
              And RTFCE120-I-Selected-I(Tally)
                                         =     'U'
                  Move  'F'              To    RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-O
                                         (Tally)
                  Move  'FELT1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)
                  Move  'Omkostnings-type'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)
                  Move  'FELT2'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)
                  Move  'Valgt'          To    R400CH01-Message-Data(2)
                  Move  'TF-SY-FIELD2-AND-FIELD1'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code
                  Perform  Z700-Error-AE
              End-If
           End-Perform
      *
           Perform
              Varying  Tally             From 1 By 1
              Until    Tally             >     RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-A
              If  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-I(Tally)
                                         Not = 'U'
              And RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-I(Tally)
                                         =     'U'
                  Move  'F'              To    RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-O
                                         (Tally)
                  Move  'FELT1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)
                  Move  'Omkostnings-type'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)
                  Move  'FELT2'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)
                  Move  'Beløp'          To    R400CH01-Message-Data(2)
                  Move  'TF-SY-FIELD2-AND-FIELD1'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code
                  Perform  Z700-Error-AE
              End-If
           End-Perform
      *
           Perform
              Varying  Tally             From 1 By 1
              Until    Tally             >     RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-A
              If  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-I(Tally)
                                         Not = 'U'
              And RTFCE120-I-Paying-Party-I(Tally)
                                         =     'U'
                  Move  'F'              To    RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-O
                                         (Tally)
                  Move  'FELT1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)
                  Move  'Omkostnings-type'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)
                  Move  'FELT2'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)
                  Move  'Betalende-Part' To    R400CH01-Message-Data(2)
                  Move  'TF-SY-FIELD2-AND-FIELD1'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code
                  Perform  Z700-Error-AE
              End-If
           End-Perform
      *
           Perform
              Varying  Tally             From 1 By 1
              Until    Tally             >     RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-A
              If  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-I(Tally)
                                         Not = 'U'
              And RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-I(Tally)
                                         =     'U'
                  Move  'F'              To    RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-O
                                         (Tally)
                  Move  'FELT1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)
                  Move  'Omkostnings-type'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)
                  Move  'FELT2'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)
                  Move  'Prosent-Provisjon'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(2)
                  Move  'TF-SY-FIELD2-AND-FIELD1'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code
                  Perform  Z700-Error-AE
              End-If
           End-Perform
      *
           Perform
              Varying  Tally             From 1 By 1
              Until    Tally             >
                                         RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-A
              If  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-I(Tally)
                                         =     'U'
              And RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-I(Tally)
                                         =     'U'
                  Move  'F'              To
                                         RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-O
                                         (Tally)
                  Move  'FELT1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)
                  Move  'Beløp'          To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)
                  Move  'FELT2'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)
                  Move  'Prosent-Provisjon'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(2)
                  Move  'TF-SY-FIELD1-NOT-FIELD2'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code
                  Perform  Z700-Error-AE
              End-If
           End-Perform
      *
           Perform
              Varying  Tally             From 1 By 1
              Until    Tally             >     RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-A
              If  RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-I(Tally)
                                         =     'U'
              And RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-I(Tally)
                                         =     'U'
                  Move  'F'              To    RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-O
                                         (Tally)
                  Move  'FELT1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)
                  Move  'Prosent-Provisjon'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)
                  Move  'FELT2'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)
                  Move  'Beløp'          To    R400CH01-Message-Data(2)
                  Move  'TF-SY-FIELD1-NOT-FIELD2'
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code
                  Perform  Z700-Error-AE
              End-If
           End-Perform
      *
      *</META>                                                          05990001
           Continue                                                     06000001
           .                                                            06010001
      *                                                                 06020001
      *<META C500-DEPENDENCIES-EX>                                      06030001
       C500-Dependencies-Ex.                                            06040001
           Exit.                                                        06050001
      *</META>                                                          06060001
                                                                        06070001
      *################################################################*06080001
      * Check dependencies between input fields                        *06090001
      * (User Code to execute before generated code)                   *06100001
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*06110001
      *<META C510-DEPENDENCIES-UB>                                      06120001
       C510-Dependencies-UB              Section.                       06130001
      *                                                                 06140001
      *</META>                                                          06150001
      *                                                                 06160001
           Continue                                                     06170001
      *                                                                 06180001
           .                                                            06190001
      *                                                                 06200001
      *<META C510-DEPENDENCIES-UB-EX>                                   06210001
       C510-Dependencies-UB-Ex.                                         06220001
           Exit.                                                        06230001
      *</META>                                                          06240001
                                                                        06250001
      *################################################################*06260001
      * Check dependencies between input fields                        *06270001
      * (User Code to execute after  generated code)                   *06280001
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*06290001
      *<META C520-DEPENDENCIES-UA>                                      06300001
       C520-Dependencies-UA              Section.                       06310001
      *                                                                 06320001
      *</META>                                                          06330001
      *                                                                 06340001
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*06350001
      * If the operation type is Return or Expire:                      06360001
      *                                                                 06370001
           If    RTFCE120-I-Operation-Type-I      = 'U'                 06381012
           and ( RTFCE120-I-Operation-Type-D      = 'RETURN'            06390009
             or  RTFCE120-I-Operation-Type-D(1:7) = 'EXPIRE-' )         06400009
      *                                                                 06410001
             Perform varying W-Ind                                      06420001
             from +1 by +1 until  W-Ind >  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-A     06430001
      *                                                                 06440001
      * - either all charges must be made to the buyer,                 06450009
      *   or all charges must be made to the seller.                    06460001
      *                                                                 06470001
               If RTFCE120-I-Paying-Party-I(W-Ind) = 'U'                06480001
                 Evaluate RTFCE120-I-Paying-Party-D(W-Ind)              06490001
                   When 'DRWEE'                                         06500001
                   When 'CUSTM'                                         06510001
                     Add   +1            To    W-Paying-Party-Is-Buyer  06520001
                   When 'DRWER'                                         06530001
                   When 'BENEF'                                         06540001
                     Add   +1            To    W-Paying-Party-Is-Seller 06550001
                   When other                                           06560001
                     Add   +1            To    W-Paying-Party-Is-Other  06570001
                 End-Evaluate                                           06580001
               End-If                                                   06590001
      *                                                                 06600001
             End-Perform                                                06610001
      *                                                                 06620001
             If (W-Paying-Party-Is-Buyer  >  +0                         06630001
             and W-Paying-Party-Is-Seller >  +0)                        06640001
              or W-Paying-Party-Is-Other  >  +0                         06650001
               Move  'TF-SY-OP-RETURN-PAY-PTY'                          06660001
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    06670001
               Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    06680001
             End-If                                                     06690001
      *                                                                 06700001
           End-If                                                       06710001
      *                                                                 06720001
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*06730001
      * When settling Import Letters of Credit, paying party for        06740003
      * Pres-Bank-Charges must be the Customer.                         06750003
      *                                                                 06760003
           If  RTFCE120-I-Operation-Type-D = 'SETTLE-ILC'               06770008
      *                                                                 06780003
             Perform varying W-Ind                                      06790003
             from +1 by +1 until  W-Ind >  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-A     06800003
      *                                                                 06810003
               If  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-D(W-Ind)                      06820004
                                         =     'PRES-BANK-CHARGES'      06830003
               and RTFCE120-I-Paying-Party-D(W-Ind)                     06840004
                                         not = 'CUSTM'                  06850003
               Then                                                     06860015
      *            Move  'TF-SY-PAY-PTY-VAR1'                           06870015
                   Move  'TF-SY-ROLE-VAR1-CH-VAR2-INV'                  06871015
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    06880004
                   Move  'VAR1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  06890005
                   Move  'Benefisiant'   To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 06900016
                   Move  'VAR2'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)  06901015
                   Move  'Pres bank charges'                            06902015
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(2) 06903015
                   Perform Z700-Error-AE                                06910004
               End-If                                                   06920004
      *                                                                 06930004
              End-Perform                                               06940013
           End-If                                                       06941013
      *                                                                 06950004
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*06951010
      * Feilretting 30.05.02 (NDL)                                      06951110
      * When accept Import Letters of Credit, paying party              06952010
      * must be the Customer.                                           06953010
      *                                                                 06954010
           If  RTFCE120-I-Operation-Type-D = 'ACCEPT-ILC'               06955010
      *                                                                 06956010
             Perform varying W-Ind                                      06957010
             from +1 by +1 until  W-Ind >  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-A     06958010
      *                                                                 06959010
               If  RTFCE120-I-Paying-Party-D(W-Ind)                     06959411
                                         not = 'CUSTM'                  06959511
               Then                                                     06959611
                   Move  'TF-SY-ROLE-VAR1-CH-VAR2-INV'                  06959715
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    06959811
                   Move  'VAR1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  06959911
                   Move  'Benefisiant'   To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 06960016
                   Move  'VAR2'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)  06960115
                   Move  'ACCEPT-ILC'    To    R400CH01-Message-Data(2) 06960215
                   Perform Z700-Error-AE                                06960315
               End-If                                                   06960415
      *                                                                 06960515
             End-Perform                                                06960618
           End-If                                                       06960718
      *                                                                 06960815
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*06961010
      * If Selected = 'Y', Paying-Party must be present, and the        06970001
      * value depends on the Contract-Type.                             06980001
      *                                                                 06990001
           Initialize                          R115ISC0-Sys-Code        07000001
           Set   R115ISC0-Version        To    True                     07010001
           Set   R115ISC0-In-Select      To    True                     07020001
           Move  'CONTRACT-TYPE'         To    R115ISC0-In-ST-Type      07030001
           Move  RTFCE120-I-Fin-Inst-No-D                               07040001
                                         To    R115ISC0-In-Fin-Inst-No  07050001
           Move  RTFCE120-I-Contract-Type-D                             07060001
                                         To    R115ISC0-In-SC-Code      07070001
      *                                                                 07080001
           Call  'F115ISC0'              Using R115ISC0-Sys-Code        07090001
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      07100001
           End-Call                                                     07110001
      *                                                                 07120001
           Evaluate True                                                07130001
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 07140001
               Move  'FM'                To    R400CH01-Message-Code    07150001
               Move  'C521'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       07160001
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       07170001
      *                                                                 07180001
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 07190001
               Move  'FM'                To    R400CH01-Message-Code    07200001
               Move  'C522'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       07210001
               Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    07220001
      *                                                                 07230001
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    07240001
               Continue                                                 07250001
      *                                                                 07260001
           End-Evaluate                                                 07270001
      *                                                                 07280001
           Perform varying W-Ind                                        07290001
           from +1 by +1 until  W-Ind    >     RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-A 07300001
      *                                                                 07310001
             Evaluate True also True                                    07320001
               When RTFCE120-I-Selected-I(W-Ind)     not = 'U'          07330001
               also any                                                 07340001
                 Continue                                               07350001
      *                                                                 07360001
               When RTFCE120-I-Selected-D(W-Ind)         = 'Y'          07370001
                and RTFCE120-I-Paying-Party-I(W-Ind) not = 'U'          07380001
               also any                                                 07390001
                 Move  'TF-SY-TYPE-MISSING'                             07400001
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    07410001
                 Perform Z700-Error-AE                                  07420001
      *                                                                 07430001
               When RTFCE120-I-Selected-D(W-Ind)        =  'Y'          07440001
               also R115ISC0-Contract-Name              =  'COLL'       07450001
                 If RTFCE120-I-Paying-Party-D(W-Ind)    =  'DRWEE'      07460001
                                                        or 'DRWER'      07470001
                    Continue                                            07480001
                 Else                                                   07490001
                    If RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-D(W-Ind) =                07500002
                       'OTH-INTERB-CHARGES'                             07510002
                       Continue                                         07520002
                    Else                                                07530002
                       Move  'TF-SY-PAY-PTY-VAR1-VAR2'                  07540002
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    07550001
                       Move  'VAR1'      To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  07560002
                       Move  'VAR2'      To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)  07570002
                       Move  'DRWEE'     To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 07580002
                       Move  'DRWER'     To    R400CH01-Message-Data(2) 07590002
                       Perform Z700-Error-AE                            07600002
                    End-If                                              07610002
                 End-If                                                 07620001
      *                                                                 07630001
               When RTFCE120-I-Selected-D(W-Ind)         = 'Y'          07640001
               also R115ISC0-Contract-Name               = 'LC'         07650001
                and R115ISC0-Contr-Imp-Exp               = 'EXPORT'     07660001
                  If RTFCE120-I-Paying-Party-D(W-Ind)    = 'BENEF'      07670001
                                                        or 'ISSUI'      07680001
                     Continue                                           07690001
                  Else                                                  07700001
                    Move  'TF-SY-PAY-PTY-VAR1-VAR2'                     07710001
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    07720001
                    Move  'VAR1'         To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  07730001
                    Move  'VAR2'         To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)  07740001
                    Move  'BENEF'        To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 07750001
                    Move  'ISSUI'        To    R400CH01-Message-Data(2) 07760001
                    Perform Z700-Error-AE                               07770001
                  End-If                                                07780001
      *                                                                 07790001
               When RTFCE120-I-Selected-D(W-Ind)         = 'Y'          07800001
               also R115ISC0-Contract-Name               = 'LC'         07810001
                and R115ISC0-Contr-Imp-Exp              or 'IMPORT'     07820001
                  If RTFCE120-I-Paying-Party-D(W-Ind)    = 'BENEF'      07830001
                                                        or 'CUSTM'      07840001
                     Continue                                           07850001
                  Else                                                  07860001
                    Move  'TF-SY-PAY-PTY-VAR1-VAR2'                     07870001
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    07880001
                    Move  'VAR1'         To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  07890001
                    Move  'VAR2'         To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)  07900001
                    Move  'BENEF'        To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 07910001
                    Move  'CUSTM'        To    R400CH01-Message-Data(2) 07920001
                    Perform Z700-Error-AE                               07930001
                  End-If                                                07940001
      *                                                                 07950001
             End-Evaluate                                               07960001
      *                                                                 07970001
           End-Perform                                                  07980001
           .                                                            07990001
      *                                                                 08000001
      *<META C520-DEPENDENCIES-UA-EX>                                   08010001
       C520-Dependencies-UA-Ex.                                         08020001
           Exit.                                                        08030001
      *</META>                                                          08040001
                                                                        08050001
      *################################################################*08060001
      * Place code necessary to prepare control of input data against  *08070001
      * database fields later here. add Perform statements of other    *08080001
      * sections for your own logic here. Preferably seperate sections *08090001
      * for each database element to be read.                          *08100001
